  "design": {
    "decision": "Buy cheap [♦] cards for length and use swaps to keep [♦]; it rewards committing to the suit in the shop.",
    "opponent": "Revealed after bidding when it applies; a long [♦] team is easy to strip by voiding [♦].",
    "rationale": "Whole-hand counts measured best in the pilot; eight of thirteen is a natural team share about a third of the time, so this fits the common +mult budget, and bought [♦] cards raise the rate.",
